          "tla": "VARIABLES pc, g, x, y\n\nvars == << pc, g, x, y >>\n\nProcSet == {1} \\cup ({ 2 , 3 })\n\nInit == /\\ g = 0\n        /\\ x = 0\n        /\\ y = [self \\in { 2 , 3 } |-> 0]\n        /\\ pc = [self \\in ProcSet |-> CASE self = 1 -> \"L\" [] self \\in { 2 , 3 } -> \"M\"]\n\nL == /\\ pc[1] = \"L\"\n     /\\ x' = 1\n     /\\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![1] = \"E\"]\n     /\\ UNCHANGED << g, y >>\n\nE == /\\ pc[1] = \"E\"\n     /\\ g' = x\n     /\\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![1] = \"Done\"]\n     /\\ UNCHANGED << x, y >>\n\nP == L \\/ E\n\nM(self) == /\\ pc[self] = \"M\"\n           /\\ y' = [y EXCEPT ![self] = 2]\n           /\\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![self] = \"F\"]\n           /\\ UNCHANGED << g, x >>\n\nF(self) == /\\ pc[self] = \"F\"\n           /\\ g' = y[self]\n           /\\ pc' = [pc EXCEPT ![self] = \"Done\"]\n           /\\ UNCHANGED << x, y >>\n\nQ(self) == M(self) \\/ F(self)\n\nTerminating == /\\ \\A self \\in ProcSet: pc[self] = \"Done\"\n               /\\ UNCHANGED vars\n\nNext == P \\/ (\\E self \\in { 2 , 3 }: Q(self)) \\/ Terminating\n\nSpec == Init /\\ [][Next]_vars\n\nTermination == <>(\\A self \\in ProcSet: pc[self] = \"Done\")\n",
